   "subject": "Re: plotOutput disappears when inline=TRUE",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">If inline=TRUE, then your renderPlot call in server.R must have width and height arguments:<br><div><br></div><div>output$basic &lt;- renderPlot({</div><div>  plot(1)</div><div>}, width = 200, height = 100)</div><div><br></div><div>or whatever.</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
